jobs.description:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Established in 2004, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;OLIVER&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; is the world’s first and only specialist in designing, building, and running bespoke in-house agencies and marketing ecosystems for brands. We partner with over 300 clients in 40+ countries and counting. Our unique model drives creativity and efficiency, allowing us to deliver tailored solutions that resonate deeply with audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a part of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The Brandtech Group&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, we&#39;re at the forefront of leveraging cutting-edge AI technology to revolutionise how we create and deliver work. Our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;AI solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; enhance efficiency, spark creativity, and drive insightful decision-making, empowering our teams to produce innovative and impactful results.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;Project Director&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Location: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;London, United Kingdom &lt;strong&gt;(2-3 days a week from Client offices in Slough/London)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As Project Director, you will be accountable for Project Management, Resource Management and delivery operations. You will report to the Managing Partner and be a key member of the senior leadership team. You will define the governance, processes and standards that keep complex, high-volume, multi-channel programmes running smoothly. You will also build and develop a Project Management team that works with accountability, collaboration and a focus on continuous improvement. A central part of the role is leading change, including the practical adoption of AI and new technologies to improve efficiency, quality and speed. You will set the vision and step into the detail when it is needed, building confidence with senior client and internal stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you will be doing:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop the Project Management and Operations teams, setting clear direction and expectations and creating a culture of accountability, collaboration and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the team&#39;s structure and capabilities to meet the evolving needs of the business. Coach and mentor Project Managers and create clear routes for progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be accountable for delivery standards across the account, so work is delivered on brief, on time and within agreed scope and commercial terms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and embed project management methodologies, governance frameworks, SLAs, quality control processes and approval frameworks across all client workstreams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee end-to-end delivery of complex, high-volume programmes across social, digital, mobile, CRM, film, video and content production, from brief and scoping through to quality assurance and final delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the senior escalation point for complex delivery challenges. Identify risks and inefficiencies early and guide them through to resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the operational framework for the Project Managers, including processes, systems, tools, playbooks, templates and standard operating procedures. Establish performance measures that show delivery health, team performance and resource utilisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the Resource Management function with our global team, planning, forecasting and allocating talent so the right people and skills are on the right projects at the right time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be responsible for the commercial health of delivery operations. Establish costing models and financial controls, and ensure projects are scoped, costed and managed to support consistent, profitable delivery. Partner with Finance, HR and Recruitment to align resourcing and commercial objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage external and offshore delivery partners so quality, cost and service expectations are consistently met.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate AI and emerging technologies across project planning, workflow management, resource optimisation, reporting, quality assurance and content production. Set quality and governance standards, lead the rollout of new tools with measurable improvements, and build team confidence through experimentation and learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with senior client stakeholders as a credible partner on delivery, operational strategy and innovation. Work with Creative, Strategy, Production, Technology and Account Management leaders, and contribute to the senior leadership agenda that shapes the account&#39;s direction and growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you need to be great in this role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading Project Management and Resource teams at director or equivalent senior level within a creative, advertising, marketing or communications agency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building, developing and coaching high-performing teams, including senior talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise overseeing complex, multi-workstream programmes and delivering consistently against quality, time and commercial objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of integrated marketing communications, particularly social-first content, digital and always-on communications. This includes the demands of high-volume content, reactive opportunities, multiple formats, platform specifications and rapid approval cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing, implementing and embedding operational processes, governance frameworks and project management methodologies, and leading systems implementation and adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial awareness, including forecasting, resource utilisation, project costing and profitability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing offshore and nearshore teams, external partners and complex delivery models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across creative, strategy, production, technology and account management functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management skills, with the ability to influence, constructively challenge and build credibility at senior levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear decision-making, with the ability to anticipate challenges, bring solutions rather than only escalate problems, and explain complex operational matters in plain terms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A commitment to innovation and continuous improvement, with the organisation to manage competing priorities and attention to detail in a fast-moving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic integration of AI across studio projects and operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience setting AI governance and quality standards at studio level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agentic leadership for complex business and delivery challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drives AI innovation and shares best practice across the OLIVER network&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Req ID:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt; 19067&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-KA1 #LI-Director #LI-Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our values shape everything we do:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Be&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Ambitious&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; to succeed &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Be &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Imaginative&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; to push the boundaries of what’s possible &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Be &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Inspirational&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; to do groundbreaking work &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Be &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;always learning and listening&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; to understand &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Be &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Results-focused &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;to exceed expectations &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Be &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;actively pro-inclusive and anti-racist&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; across our community, clients and creations  &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Our recruitment process does not employ artificial intelligence for selection. We use AI to support efficiency and consistency, not to replace human judgement.&amp;nbsp;Candidate evaluation and selection are conducted without AI-supported screening or decision-making. We are committed to a fair, thoughtful, and equitable experience for every candidate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;OLIVER,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;a part of the Brandtech Group, is an equal opportunity employer committed to creating an inclusive working environment where all employees are encouraged to reach their full potential, and individual differences are valued and respected. All applicants shall be considered for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, religion, gender, sexual orientation, gender identity, age, neurodivergence, disability status, or any other characteristic protected by local laws. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; OLIVER has set ambitious environmental goals around sustainability, with science-based emissions reduction targets. Collectively, we work towards our mission, embedding sustainability into every department and through every stage of the project lifecycle.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BOUT TIDE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tide, we help SMEs save time and money in the running of their businesses by not only offering business accounts and related banking services, but also a comprehensive set of highly usable and connected administrative solutions, from invoicing to accounting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tide is transforming the small business banking market and now supports over 2 million members globally across the UK, Germany and France.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Using advanced technology, all solutions are designed with SMEs in mind. With quick onboarding, low fees and innovative features, we thrive on making data driven decisions to serve our mission: to help SMEs save time and money so they can get back to doing what they love.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tide facts:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tide is available for UK, German and French SMEs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over 2 million members globally and rapidly growing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over $300 million raised in funding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3,000 Tideans globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have offices in Central London, with a member support and technology centre in Sofia, Bulgaria, technology centres in Serbia, Romania, Lithuania and Hyderabad and offices in Gurugram, New Delhi, Berlin, Paris and Luxembourg&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Tide Security Engineering team is made up of three core areas: Product Security, Identity, Threat Detection &amp;amp; Response&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Security&lt;/strong&gt; consists of application and cloud security experts. Their mission is to protect the products we build, covering everything from secure design reviews to threat modelling and penetration testing, ensuring security is embedded from the ground up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Threat Detection &amp;amp; Response&lt;/strong&gt; (this role!) focuses on protecting the company by building a robust detection and automation platform. We’re proactive in our defence, constantly hacking ourselves to improve our security posture and staying ahead of emerging threats. Our goal is to make Tide resilient against the ever-evolving threat landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identity&lt;/strong&gt; is responsible for managing Tide&#39;s staff identity platform, ensuring that access to systems and infrastructure is secure, seamless, and aligned with modern security practices. The team uses strategies like zero trust, multi-factor authentication, and granular role-based access controls to safeguard our internal operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While each area has its own focus, collaboration is key - it&#39;s why we share the same Slack channel and hold our standups together as one cohesive team, ensuring alignment and seamless communication across all security functions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Security Operations Responder, you’ll be on the front line of defending Tide. Your primary focus is actively investigating threats through our security data lake and SOAR platform – but we don’t want anyone working the same alert by hand twice. Your goal is to make investigation effective at scale: cutting manual effort through automation, and working hand-in-hand with our Detection Engineering team to improve the true positive / false positive efficacy of what lands in the queue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When the security queue is empty, you’ll be building – automations, enrichment and your own detections. An open mind and a curious approach are key: every investigation is a chance to make the next one faster and sharper.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a Security Operations Responder, you’ll be:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Investigating and responding to threats (your primary focus)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively triaging and investigating security alerts and threats through our security data lake and SOAR platform, across AWS, GCP, SaaS (such as Google Workspace and Okta), internal applications and employee endpoints (Windows, macOS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving every investigation to a clear, well-evidenced outcome – establishing scope, impact and root cause, and taking containment and remediation actions quickly and confidently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading the response to complex or high-severity incidents where needed, coordinating across security, IT and engineering teams through containment, remediation and recovery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Documenting investigations clearly and consistently, and contributing to the runbooks and investigation standards the whole team works to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Scaling investigation through automation &amp;amp; Improving detection efficacy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reducing manual investigation by building SOAR playbooks, security automations and services – from data enrichment and context gathering through to automated response, such as removing phishing emails from employee mailboxes. We want you to run with the “anything is possible” mantra.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spotting repetitive work in the queue and turning it into automated workflows, so the team’s time goes on the investigations that genuinely need human judgement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying gaps in log sources, parsing and enrichment in the data lake, and working to close them so investigations have the visibility they need.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feeding investigation outcomes back to the Detection Engineering team – flagging noisy rules, tuning false positives and highlighting coverage gaps – to continuously improve TP/FP efficacy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tracking investigation metrics (such as MTTD, MTTR, TP/FP rate and automation coverage) and using them to prioritise where to improve next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Building when the queue is clear&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Writing, testing and shipping your own detections alongside Detection Engineering, following our test-driven, detections-as-code practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively hunting for sophisticated threats across our infrastructure, using threat intelligence and lessons from past investigations to stay ahead of attackers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building or enhancing internal tools that streamline investigation, improve data visibility and increase response efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sharing knowledge and mentoring other members of the team, raising the bar for how we investigate and respond.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;WHAT WE ARE LOOKING FOR&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant hands-on experience in security operations, incident response or threat investigation, ideally in a cloud-native environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong investigative instincts and log analysis skills at scale, with the ability to query a security data lake or SIEM fluently – strong knowledge of one of the following: Splunk, Scanner, Sentinel, SecOps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of modern attack and defence techniques which apply to Cloud (AWS, GCP), SaaS (such as Google Workspace and Okta) and desktop (Windows and macOS) environments, and the ability to map activity to frameworks such as MITRE ATT&amp;amp;CK.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience in security automation, from writing scripts (e.g. Python) to creating end-to-end automated workflows. Familiarity with SOAR platforms and automating investigation and response tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience writing or tuning detections, and a clear view of what separates a high-fidelity alert from a noisy one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Calm, methodical judgement during live incidents, including knowing when and how to escalate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An open mind and a curious approach – you enjoy pulling on threads, and you don’t stop at “false positives” without understanding why.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on attitude and the ability to drive solutions to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for passing on knowledge to fellow colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent spoken and written communication skills, including clear investigation write-ups for both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus points if you have a repository showcasing automations, detections or tooling you’ve built.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;WHAT YOU’LL GET IN RETURN:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Group Life Insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vitality Health Insurance, with a proactive focus on mental and physical wellbeing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;24/7 Employee Assistance Programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days holiday with the ability to buy extra days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We invest in your development with a £1,000 professional L&amp;amp;D budget per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to ‘salary sacrifice’ benefits such as Cycle to Work scheme and pension contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spacious brand-new office in Liverpool street with an all-day snacks bar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced family-friendly leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 days for L&amp;amp;D or volunteering time off per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sabbatical leave&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;TIDEAN WAYS OF WORKING&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tide, we champion a &lt;strong&gt;flexible workplace &lt;/strong&gt;model that&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;supports both in-person and remote work to cater to the specific needs of our different teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While remote work is supported, we believe in the power of face-to-face interactions to foster team spirit and collaboration. Our offices are designed as hubs for innovation and team-building, where we encourage regular in-person gatherings to foster a strong sense of community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-MP1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;TIDE IS A PLACE FOR EVERYONE&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tide, we believe that we can only succeed if we let our differences enrich our culture. Our Tideans come from a variety of backgrounds and experience levels. We consider everyone irrespective of their ethnicity, religion, sexual orientation, gender identity, family or parental status, national origin, veteran, neurodiversity or differently-abled status. We celebrate diversity in our workforce as a cornerstone of our success. Our commitment to a broad spectrum of ideas and backgrounds is what enables us to build products that resonate with our members’ diverse needs and lives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are One Team and foster a transparent and inclusive environment, where everyone’s voice is heard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Tide, we thrive on diversity, embracing various backgrounds and experiences. We welcome all individuals regardless of ethnicity, religion, sexual orientation, gender identity, or disability. Our inclusive culture is key to our success, helping us build products that meet our members&#39; diverse needs. We are One Team, committed to transparency and ensuring everyone’s voice is heard.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disclaimer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;It has come to our attention that individuals or agencies are falsely claiming to represent Tide and are reaching out to candidates regarding job opportunities. Please be aware that:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tide does&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;not&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;charge any fees at any stage of the recruitment process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;All official Tide job opportunities are listed exclusively on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.tide.co/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Careers Page&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and applications should be submitted through this channel.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Communication from Tide will only come from an official&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;@tide&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;.co&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;email address.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tide does not work with agencies or recruiters without prior formal engagement, and we do not authorize third parties to make job offers on our behalf.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you are contacted by anyone misrepresenting Tide or requesting payment, please treat it as fraudulent and report it to us immediately at &lt;a ----- ----- safety and trust are important to us, and we are committed to ensuring a fair and transparent recruitment process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
